# Build context exclusions for the repository-root image builds (api, web).
# No .env file at any depth reaches a build, except the committed
# .env.example; `make check-images` (CI `images` job) checks it (#610).
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
**/.venv
**/venv
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
# The API test image copies the whole repository (#672 D1): no local test
# output, Storybook builds, Terraform providers or caches, and none of the
# local-only files that hold sessions or passwords (E2E storage state, the
# load-test accounts and results).
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
**/storybook-static
**/.terraform
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
e2e/.auth
infrastructure/load/accounts.local.json
infrastructure/load/out
